      "  median onset_shift_min (confidence - refined): 30.0 min\n",
      "  episodes shifted > 10 min earlier: 3416\n",
      "  episodes shifted > 20 min earlier: 2702\n",
      "  [OK]  Onset shift >= 0 (refined starts at or before confidence).\n",
      "  median duration_min:  90.0  max: 560.0\n",
      "  [OK]  10.8% of episodes exceed 180 min.\n"
     ]
    }
